         * stub invented.
         */
        artifactListResult?: unknown;
        /** Status the stub answers the artifact list with. */
        artifactListStatus?: number;
        /** Status the stub answers the artifact content read with. */
        artifactContentStatus?: number;
        /**
         * Body the stub answers GET /session/:id/turn-index with. A scenario
         * that asserts which turns a reader is shown has to supply its own
         * index, or it is checking the two turns the stub invented.
         */
        turnIndexPage?: unknown;
        /** Status the stub answers the turn index read with. */
        turnIndexStatusCode?: number;
        /**
         * #192. Mount the harness's host-actions store: one action, the
         * launcher, not running until one start has run. Left unset the
         * routes answer 404, which is the case where the page draws no row.
         */
        hostActions?: boolean;
        /**
         * #190. Run the gateway on a real daemon pool whose spawned daemons
         * answer live-state with `liveState(cwd)` (see bootViewer's `pool`),
